          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>LAMININE isn’t just another health supplement, it’s a breakthrough advancement in pet aging science. Unmatched by anything else on the market, our scientifically proven formula is designed with one goal in mind, to give you more years of cherished memories with your beloved pet.</p><p>LAMININE doesn’t just mask signs of aging, it helps reverse them. Telomeres are the caps that protect the ends of DNA. As pets age, their telomeres shorten, leading to common age-related issues. Our human-grade formula, enriched with growth factors like FGF-2, works at the DNA level to rejuvenate these vital functions and promote telomere lengthening. You won’t just add years to your pet’s life, you’ll improve the quality of every single moment you share together.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_GV4nCa": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "Suggested Use",
            "content": "<p>The suggested usage varies by animal. The vets we have consulted with who use LAMININE in their practices recommend the following usage.</p><p>For dogs and cats (split equally in order to consume twice daily):</p><p>0-40 pounds: ½ to 1 capsule daily</p><p>40-80 pounds: 2 capsules daily</p><p>80-100 pounds: 3 capsules daily</p><p>For horses, the suggested usage is approximately 4 capsules daily.</p>",
            "page": ""
