            "subheading": "0-4 Weeks",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>When pets first start taking LAMININE their body’s cell activator sites start interacting with the growth factors, peptides, and amino acids in LAMININE. You might notice your pet having more energy within the first few weeks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_8CWgJN": {
