            "navigation_label": "4-8 Weeks",
            "subheading": "4-8 Weeks",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>As your pet continues with LAMININE, you'll likely observe a further increase in vitality and a decrease in any discomfort related to joint issues. They may exhibit increased playfulness and agility.</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_aTbYjb": {
