            "content": "<p>Now that LAMININE has had at least 60 days of repairing and lengthening telomeres, the caps that protect your pet's DNA from damage, you’ll probably notice your pet has a healthier, shiner coat, increased physical health, and improved organ functions.</p>"
          }
