    "testimonials_HfwGRC": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_Ypj68p": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Rodica",
            "title": "Healthier and Happier",
            "content": "<p>LAMININE helped improve my dog's energy levels and mood. After a month, I went to the vet for my dog's bloodwork and the results showed that his previously slightly elevated lymphocyte count, a marker often linked with stress, dropped to near-normal levels—a change confirmed by my veterinarian as an indicator of reduced stress.</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_wG7Lwi": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Marilou V.",
            "title": "Very satisfied with the product",
            "content": "<p>I have a 12 year old blue heeler with quite a large tumor on her back taking laminine. I know it is going to take time to see result with her lump but she has lost some weight, her fur has softened and she can now keep up with our younger dog & has a lot more interest in life.</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_tUPQpp": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "John S.",
            "title": "Great customer care",
            "content": "<p>My 9-year-old Labrador, Sam, was having trouble with his hips and struggled to move around easily. But after giving him three pills of Laminine within 24 hours, his mobility dramatically improved. Now, he’s back to running along the road and jumping into the truck with no issues.</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Hgi8Hj": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "round_avatar": true,
            "show_rating": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Ken M.",
            "title": "Laminine experience",
            "content": "<p>I’ve been giving my Labrador Laminine for bilateral laryngeal fold collapse, a condition causing breathing difficulties. Surgery was the only option, but it’s risky and not guaranteed. Early signs are promising, with my husband noticing improved breathing during exercise. He even wonders if the collapse could be reversing itself.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
